<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuehne &amp; Nagel H1 profit rises 12.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Kuehne &amp; Nagel H1 profit rises 12.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SCHINDELLEGI, Switzerland 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			31.9		vs 28.4</p>
<p> Turnover			 2,460.9	   vs 2,509.9</p>
<p> Operating earnings	   71.8		vs 72.2</p>
<p> Taxes			    23.3		vs 24.7</p>
<p> Cash flow			56.0		vs 47.5</p>
<p> Investments		    68.7		vs 37.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of freight forwarding group is Kuehne &amp; Nagel International AG. -- Zurich Newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
